<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>9.5.3: Finding Irrational Solutions by Completing the Square</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m02410</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.5.3: Finding Irrational Solutions by Completing the Square</md:title>
    <md:uuid>4819898a-c943-4521-8239-1e4960af0a60</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
    <section class="numbered-exercises" id="sect-00001">      <title>Activity</title>
      <note id="note-00001" class="link-to-learning">
        <para id="para-00001">Access the <link url="https://k12.openstax.org/contents/raise/resources/2c2987f83130584132cad08b60ad0d3ba45a32b9">Desmos guide PDF</link> for tips on solving problems with the Desmos graphing calculator.</para>
      </note>
      <para id="para-00002">Here is an example of an equation being solved by graphing and by <term class="glossary-tooltip" id="term-00001">completing the square</term>.</para>
      <para id="para-00003">
          <media alt="Insert Alt Text">
            <image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/Algebra-1_10_07_06_01.svg"/>
          </media>
        
     </para>
      <para id="para-00004"><m:math xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
        <m:mtable columnalign="right center left">
          <m:mtr>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>7</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd>
          </m:mtr>
          <m:mtr>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>6</m:mn>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>9</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd>
          </m:mtr>
          <m:mtr>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
                <m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo>
                <m:msup>
                  <m:mi/>
                  <m:mn>2</m:mn>
                </m:msup>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mtd>
          </m:mtr>
          <m:mtr>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mrow>
                <m:mi>x</m:mi>
                <m:mo>+</m:mo>
                <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              </m:mrow>
            </m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mi>±</m:mi>
              <m:msqrt>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>
            </m:mtd>
          </m:mtr>
          <m:mtr>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mi>x</m:mi>
            </m:mtd>
            <m:mtd><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd>
            <m:mtd>
              <m:mo>−</m:mo>
              <m:mn>3</m:mn>
              <m:mi>±</m:mi>
              <m:msqrt>
                <m:mn>2</m:mn>
              </m:msqrt>
            </m:mtd>
          </m:mtr>
        </m:mtable>
      </m:math></para><para id="para-00005">Verify: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:math> is approximately 1.414. So <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.586</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>4.414</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
      <para id="para-00006">For each equation, find the exact solutions by completing the square and the approximate solutions by graphing. Then, verify that the solutions found using the two methods are close. If you get stuck, refer back to the example.</para>
      <exercise id="exer-00001">
        <problem id="prob-00001">
          <para id="para-00007"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00008">Find the exact solutions by completing the square.</para>
          <para id="para-00009">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00001">
          <para id="para-00010">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00011"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
      </exercise>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00001">
        <item>Graph the equation to find approximate solutions.</item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00012">Use the Desmos graphing tool or technology outside the course.</para>
      <media alt="...">
        <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500" height="400"/>
      </media>
      <exercise id="exer-00002">
        <problem id="prob-00002">
          <para id="para-00013">When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00002">
          <para id="para-00014">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00015">
                  <media alt="">
                <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_10_07_06_02.jpg"/>
              </media>
            
         </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="e4b9dc8d-0ea3-4566-af06-451d36647eee" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00003">
          <para id="para-00016">Are the solutions you found using the two methods close?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00003">
          <para id="para-00017">Correct! Yes. Solutions were the same: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.268</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3.732</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00018">Incorrect. The correct answer is Yes. Solutions were the same: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.268</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>3.732</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00003">
        <problem id="prob-00004">
          <para id="para-00019"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mi>−</m:mi><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00020">Find the exact solutions by completing the square.</para>
          <para id="para-00021">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00004">
          <para id="para-00022">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00023"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="false">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:msup><m:mo stretchy="false">)</m:mo><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt><m:mspace linebreak="newline"/><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mi/><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mrow></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
      </exercise>
      <list class="os-raise-noindent" list-type="enumerated" id="list-00002">
        <item>Graph the equation to find approximate solutions.</item>
      </list>
      <para id="para-00024">Use the Desmos graphing tool or technology outside the course.</para>
      <media alt="...">
        <iframe src="../../media/desmos/a47b5bb4ba783be55a7067b919f165f14dcc36ce.html" width="500" height="400"/>
      </media>
      <exercise id="exer-00004">
        <problem id="prob-00005">
          <para id="para-00025">When you have finished graphing, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00005">
          <para id="para-00026">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00027">
                  <media alt="">
                <image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/Algebra-1_10_07_06_03.jpg"/>
              </media>
            
         </para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="_0f0d59d2-2fcd-4daf-ac6a-c1ab9c931506" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00006">
          <para id="para-00028">Are the solutions you found using the two methods close?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00006">
          <para id="para-00029">Correct! Yes. Solutions were the same: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>7.646</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>2.354</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00030">Incorrect. The correct answer is Yes. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>7.646</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mn>2.354</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
      </exercise>
      <exercise id="exer-00005">
        <problem id="prob-00007">
          <para id="para-00031"><m:math><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para><para id="para-00032">Find the exact solutions by completing the square.</para>
          <para id="para-00033">Write down your answer, then select the <emphasis>solution</emphasis> button to compare your work.</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00007">
          <para id="para-00034">Compare your answer:</para>
          <para id="para-00035"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">(</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:msup><m:mrow><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="prefix">(</m:mo><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mo stretchy="true" fence="true" form="postfix">)</m:mo></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msup></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mi>x</m:mi></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="center"><m:mo>=</m:mo></m:mtd><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mfrac><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mfrac><m:mi>±</m:mi><m:msqrt><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:msqrt></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:mrow></m:math></para></solution>
      </exercise>
