      <exercise id="b14e169f-7b9e-4e99-ac18-2c18cbeddb81" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00012">
          <para id="para-00051">Are the solutions you found using the two methods close?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00012">
          <para id="para-00052">Correct! Yes. Solutions were the same: <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.862</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.805</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
          <para id="para-00053">Incorrect. The correct answer is Yes. <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>0.862</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> and <m:math display="inline"><m:mrow><m:mi>x</m:mi><m:mo>≈</m:mo><m:mo>−</m:mo><m:mn>1.805</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
        </solution>
